1142: SLPI stage 3, bergamotaslpi=3 (= stage 2 with pas=1 auth=1, the sub-bits cannot lower them): after "SLPI READY" bring up the SLPI's
GLINK edge on the 1141 transport (remote pid 3, doorbell bit 24, SMEM items 478/479/480 in apps<->slpi), open IPCRTR, QRTR hello, and
log every NEW_SERVER (service/version/instance/node:port, with a banner for SEE 0x190), lookups, unknown data packets (hex) and the
SLPI's other GLINK channel opens. Answers only HELLO, pd-mapper (0x40) lookups and GET_DOMAIN_LIST. No FastRPC. Hold: bergamotaslpihold
(default 60 for stage 3); bergamotaslpikeep=1 keeps servicing the edge until a fatal error. Requires 1137, 1141.

